From 0e6847eeb3bff365bb5e44754eed17388cb1f7ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Milad <mmaziesf@uwaterloo.ca>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:59:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Add glasses.capture: Ray-Ban Meta frames from a home
 relay

Muse can ask the gadget for the latest frame from the user's Meta Ray-Ban
glasses. The command (CONFIG_HOMEHUB_GLASSES_CAPTURE) fetches one JPEG over
HTTP from a relay on the home network (CONFIG_HOMEHUB_GLASSES_CAPTURE_URL,
set per device like the SDK token) in a background task and returns it as
base64, the same result shape as camera.capture. Enabled on the Core2 v1.1
profile.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
